- We hope you guys enjoy!

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.640
"In Texas it's abstinence, abstinence, abstinence...

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:12.360
They told us in the health class just not to have sex.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:16.300
It's hard, I mean, every guy's nightmare is getting their girlfriend pregnant. And...

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:18.860
sometimes it comes true [chuckles]

