Well, I do come from a Hispanic family and also the religion, and you had to be married before having intercourse and having a kid

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:27.440
so we kept the baby a secret for three months, also to make sure he stuck before we told everybody and

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:35.720
We found out I was pregnant on a Wednesday and I got married that Saturday. Yeah, so he's really, really involved.  [laughs]

