00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:45.060
We were planning to get married the month after.

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:45.560
Okay

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:47.560
We were still gonna get married this young it's just...

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:50.540
He came a little earlier. [laughs]

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:52.440
When I was 14,

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:58.609
I got pregnant and my boyfriend was 14 as well and we had already broken up before I found out I was pregnant.

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:04.000
So when I found out I was pregnant his initial reaction was just like freaking out, get an abortion,

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:06.220
even though you're three months along and

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:12.230
One of the first things he did, was say, I'm harassing him and blocked me. We got a paternity test.

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:16.189
He decided that I was some type of slut after I found out I was pregnant

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:23.060
Even though he was the only person I had ever been with and after the paternity test the court introduced visitation

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:29.240
She was 10 months old. She was... sorry. She was 10 months old and she finally got to meet her dad and umm..

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:31.860
The visitation kept up for a while

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:34.700
but recently he's been getting into fights and...

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:39.770
I mean, he hasn't seen her in a few months and I don't know if I want him in her life

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:44.870
I don't think it's healthy for her. I'd rather do it alone than with him at this point

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:49.250
What you expect from a boyfriend and what you expect from a father are totally different things.

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:51.859
Totally, totally different things and especially,

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:55.369
since men mature way slower than girls...-

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:56.980
-Yeah

00:07:56.980 --> 00:07:58.209
-and the fact that we carry them for nine months

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:02.020
and we're up late at night if whether we breastfeed or bottle feeding or whatever

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:07.629
we are just so inclined to these little human beings and for guys...you really have to be there to do that and

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:10.899
sometimes they don't want to be there or they can't be there for that.

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:12.160
-They want to milk the teenage years,

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:17.260
especially since they are still teenagers they are still kids and they want to go party, they want to live their lives.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:21.999
So sometimes it's hard. I mean every guy's nightmare is getting their girlfriend pregnant and

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:24.680
Sometimes it comes true.

