And I would give them so many scenarios of do you have a job? Are you ready for it?

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:07.900
Are you mentally prepared for it, some people...

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:08.800
-That's the funny part,

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:10.520
it's like everyone always thinks about the

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:14.560
financials and they always think about do you have a place and this and that. I'm like I get it those are so

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:16.740
incredibly huge but like mentally

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:19.940
Every parent that I've ever met, it's like, it's hard being a parent at any age.

00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:20.500
-Yeah.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:25.260
So let alone figuring yourself out and then you're figuring out a little human being as well.

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:28.000
I think there's a huge difference between

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:31.200
supporting teen moms and supporting teens to become moms

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:32.880
I think there's a big difference between that

